---
/**
 * Overall system topology: public edge, modular monolith, local storage and
 * the two optional workerd processes.
 */
---

<figure class="fc-diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 920 720"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="fc-system-title fc-system-desc"
  >
    <title id="fc-system-title">Fastcart system topology</title>
    <desc id="fc-system-desc">
      Browsers reach the single Rust fastcart-serve process, which contains the
      HTTP edge, authentication and store resolution, commerce modules,
      workflows and durable jobs, the SSR gateway and the plugin host manager.
      It reads the platform database and one SQLite database per store. Two
      separate workerd processes run storefront artifacts and plugins; plugins
      reach the host API through a bridge and reach external hosts only through
      an egress proxy.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="fc-system-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="9"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="fc-arrow"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Actors -->
    <rect class="fc-box-accent" x="20" y="70" width="150" height="64" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="95" y="94" text-anchor="middle">Admin SPA</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="95" y="114" text-anchor="middle">React · cookie + CSRF</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-accent" x="20" y="180" width="150" height="64" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="95" y="204" text-anchor="middle">Storefront</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="95" y="224" text-anchor="middle">HTML + hydration</text>

    <!-- Public server -->
    <rect class="fc-box-muted" x="200" y="30" width="470" height="600" rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="216" y="54">fastcart-serve</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="322" y="54">Rust process · public entry point</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="220" y="70" width="430" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="236" y="94">HTTP edge</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="236" y="112">request id · metrics · CORS · body limits</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="220" y="146" width="430" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="236" y="170">Auth + store context</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="236" y="188">platform session · Host → active store</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-brand" x="220" y="222" width="430" height="86" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="236" y="246">Commerce modules</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="236" y="266">catalog · pricing · cart · checkout · order</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="236" y="284">payment · inventory · content · customers</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="220" y="330" width="430" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="236" y="354">Workflows + outbox + jobs</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="236" y="372">compose modules · durable events · leases</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="220" y="414" width="200" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="236" y="438">Plugin host manager</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="236" y="456">bundles · dispatcher</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="450" y="414" width="200" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="466" y="438">SSR gateway</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="466" y="456">trusted context · streams</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-info" x="220" y="500" width="430" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="236" y="524">Internal APIs + assets</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="236" y="542">/internal/* · /_fastcart/assets/* · token checks</text>

    <!-- Data -->
    <path class="fc-box" d="M 220 674 v 20 a 80 11 0 0 0 160 0 v-20"></path>
    <ellipse class="fc-box" cx="300" cy="674" rx="80" ry="11"></ellipse>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="300" y="700" text-anchor="middle">Platform SQLite</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="300" y="714" text-anchor="middle">registry · auth</text>

    <path class="fc-box" d="M 410 674 v 20 a 80 11 0 0 0 160 0 v-20"></path>
    <ellipse class="fc-box" cx="490" cy="674" rx="80" ry="11"></ellipse>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="490" y="700" text-anchor="middle">Store SQLite</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="490" y="714" text-anchor="middle">one database per store</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="560" y="664" width="150" height="50" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="635" y="686" text-anchor="middle">Object storage</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="635" y="704" text-anchor="middle">assets · backups</text>

    <!-- Runtimes -->
    <rect class="fc-box-muted" x="730" y="160" width="170" height="140" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="746" y="184">workerd · SSR</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="746" y="202">framework artifact</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="746" y="216" width="138" height="30" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="815" y="235" text-anchor="middle">fetch → HTML / stream</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="815" y="270" text-anchor="middle">one process per</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="815" y="286" text-anchor="middle">active deployment</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-muted" x="730" y="360" width="170" height="170" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="746" y="384">workerd · plugins</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="746" y="402">shared process</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="746" y="416" width="138" height="30" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="815" y="435" text-anchor="middle">gateway + loader</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="746" y="456" width="138" height="46" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="815" y="474" text-anchor="middle">plugin isolates</text>
    <text class="fc-mono-muted" x="815" y="492" text-anchor="middle">bridge</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-muted" x="730" y="590" width="170" height="70" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="746" y="614">External providers</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="746" y="632">payments · email</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="746" y="648">allowlisted APIs</text>

    <!-- Arrows -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 170 102 H 218" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="183" y="94">HTTPS</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 170 212 H 190 V 110 H 218" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 435 124 V 144" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 435 200 V 220" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 435 308 V 328" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 384 V 412" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="400">events</text>

    <!-- Edge to runtime managers -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 220 97 H 210 V 441 H 218" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="206" y="300" transform="rotate(-90 206 300)" text-anchor="middle">admin API</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 670 97 H 680 V 441 H 672" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="691" y="300" transform="rotate(-90 691 300)" text-anchor="middle">SSR routing</text>

    <!-- Managers to runtimes -->
    <path class="fc-line-brand" d="M 650 441 H 700 V 230 H 728" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>

    <path class="fc-line-brand" d="M 320 468 V 480 H 710 V 450 H 728" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Bridge and egress -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 730 500 H 700 V 528 H 652" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 815 530 V 588" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="823" y="566">egress proxy</text>

    <!-- Data links -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 300 630 V 662" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 630 V 662" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 635 630 V 662" marker-end="url(#fc-system-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="308" y="650">platform data</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="498" y="650">store data</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="643" y="650">blobs</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Figure 1.</strong> One public Rust process, two optional
    <code>workerd</code> processes. SSR deployments and plugins never share a
    process: their lifetime, configuration and trust domains differ. Storage is
    local: a platform database, one SQLite database per store, and a filesystem
    object store.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
